  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Synthetic leather upper for premium comfort and durability\nNike Swoosh and Air Max motifs on the upper for heritage style\nElastic laces\nFoam midsole provides additional comfort and lasting underfoot support\nPull tabs for easy on and off\nDurable rubber outsole for reliable grip across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Max Fire Stretch Lace Casual Shoes are imported.\nHeat up the streets in these Infant and Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max Fire Stretch Lace Casual Shoes. A newcomer to the legendary Air Max lineage, these sneakers are crafted with a durable synthetic leather upper featuring wavy overlays for blazing-hot style, and feature foam cushioning for long-lasting comfort.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Infant and Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max Fire Stretch Lace Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Toddler</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Volt/Barely Volt/Black/Dark Smoke Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3493672</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary